      "description": "QX30 Gateway, configuration/reprogramming, and immobilizer functions remain unrestored. Services have been restored except for the QX30: As previously communicated, NML initiated an emergency shutdown of certain CONSULT-related services on November 13 in connection with a cybersecurity investigation. The affected CONSULT-III plus online services have been restored and are available for use. As part of the restoration process, users may be prompted to reset their passwords when accessing CONSULT-III plus. Restored functions: ECU programming/reprogramming ECU configuration ECU/Gateway unlocking ECU MAC key writing Immobilizer functions NOTE: QX30 Gateway, configuration/reprogramming, and immobilizer functions remain unrestored. CONSULT-IV was not affected by this outage.",
